OL,3,GNEWSALabour wins Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Aby-election, beating Green leader Zack
OL,5,APolanski
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour wins the Holborn and St Pancras
OL,8,Fby-election, with the Greens coming in
OL,9,Fsecond and the Conservatives in third -
OL,10,Fhere's how the night unfolded
OL,12,FCamden Council leader Sagal Abdi-Wali -
OL,13,Fwho secured 45% of the vote - says it
OL,14,Fis an "extraordinary honour" to
OL,15,Frepresent the constituency, which has
OL,16,Fbeen Labour since it was created in
OL,17,F1983
OL,19,F"Whether you voted for me or not my
OL,20,Fcommitment to this community runs
OL,21,Fdeep," she tells those gathered at the
OL,22,Fcount
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
